{"uid":"eb8244f1eb9d697c","name":"test_review_ladder_exhaustion_with_budget_remaining_asks_review_again","fullName":"tests.flows.test_flow_review_replan_pause#test_review_ladder_exhaustion_with_budget_remaining_asks_review_again","historyId":"e673c46f16588428afcca0564cf5098f","time":{"start":1791959815620,"stop":1791959817397,"duration":1777},"description":"GH #209 defect 2, at the flow tier, in v0.36 form. An unparseable\n    review reply exhausts the ladder; that is not a rejection (approach 1\n    stays UNARCHIVED, no composite PRD, `verdict:review:unreviewed@1`). It\n    used to HOLD the run `paused` for the operator (`review_contract_\n    unrepaired`, one `operator_escalation`, `POST /resume`); since F.3 it is\n    an infra fault under the unchanged outage budget once the\n    `judge_retry_max` (default 2) judge retries are spent too: three\n    unreadable invocations, then the engine waits out the backoff and asks\n    review again over the SAME approach, where the stub's next (well-formed)\n    reply verifies. The run is never `paused`.\n\n    Every other assertion survives, recounted for the retries:\n    `review-count == \"4\"` (three exhausted real invocations, one passing one\n    -- the ladder's uncharged re-asks never advance the marker), every task\n    `completed`, `usage.byPhase.contract` non-empty, and budget genuinely\n    left over.","descriptionHtml":"<p>GH #209 defect 2, at the flow tier, in v0.36 form. An unparseable<br />\nreview reply exhausts the ladder; that is not a rejection (approach 1<br />\nstays UNARCHIVED, no composite PRD, <code>verdict:review:unreviewed@1</code>). It<br />\nused to HOLD the run <code>paused</code> for the operator (<code>review_contract_ unrepaired</code>, one <code>operator_escalation</code>, <code>POST /resume</code>); since F.3 it is<br />\nan infra fault under the unchanged outage budget once the<br />\n<code>judge_retry_max</code> (default 2) judge retries are spent too: three<br />\nunreadable invocations, then the engine waits out the backoff and asks<br />\nreview again over the SAME approach, where the stub's next (well-formed)<br />\nreply verifies. The run is never <code>paused</code>.</p>\n<pre><code>Every other assertion survives, recounted for the retries:\n`review-count == &quot;4&quot;` (three exhausted real invocations, one passing one\n-- the ladder's uncharged re-asks never advance the marker), every task\n`completed`, `usage.byPhase.contract` non-empty, and budget genuinely\nleft over.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791959389075,"stop":1791959389075,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791959389076,"stop":1791959389076,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791959815591,"stop":1791959815599,"duration":8},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791959815591,"stop":1791959815591,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791959815599,"stop":1791959815600,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":fa